cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KPR-pipeline in research, please cite the software and associated study."
type: software
title: "KPR-pipeline: Korean Pangenome Reference construction and analysis"
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Kim"
    given-names: "Jae-Yoon"
    affiliation: "Genomic Medicine Research Center, Korea Research Institute of Bioscience and Biotechnology (KRIBB)"
abstract: >-
  Eight command-line workflows for Korean long-read genome assembly and
  quality assessment, ensemble gene annotation, pangenome construction,
  variant comparison and benchmarking, GIAB trio genotype inheritance
  inconsistency assessment, graph-based short-read mapping, and
  structural and population-genetic analysis of the AMY locus.
  Source code and documentation are provided; input datasets and
  pangenome graph resources are distributed separately.
keywords:
  - pangenome
  - Korean genomes
  - genome assembly
  - graph genome
  - structural variants
  - variant benchmarking
  - AMY locus
  - population genetics
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/JaeYoonKim72/KPR-pipeline"
url: "https://github.com/JaeYoonKim72/KPR-pipeline"
